graph TD
    A[Root: Function Signature] --> B{MCTS Engine}
    B --> C[Selection: PUCT Heuristic]
    C --> D[Expansion: LLM Candidate Gen]
    D --> E[Simulation: Code Sandbox]
    E --> F{Evaluation}
